-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §144 (part מ): parts ט to יב apply to existing
-- non-academic kindergarten teachers with the changes needed, the
-- multiplier of the conversion coefficient being 0.9 instead of 0.8.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `144`

@ref akn:art_144
`the multiplier for a non-academic kindergarten teacher` MEANS 0.9
`the multiplier parts ט–יב set` MEANS 0.8

#ASSERT `the multiplier for a non-academic kindergarten teacher` GREATER THAN `the multiplier parts ט–יב set`
